window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Oli Hart is an omega superstar loved by many. We are a smaller band whose old lead singer is tearing us apart from the inside.</b></p> <p>When our label demotes us from our own headlining act to be her band, we are furious... until we meet her.</p> <p>We want to hate her, but she's too perfect. Oli is bright, positive, bubbly, and everything we could dream of in an omega. She doesn't have a malicious bone in her body and has advocated for us from the beginning. It should be perfect.</p> <p>It didn't take long for the three of us to realize the label might have been doing us a favor with this one. But our fourth packmate? He's closed off and refuses to entertain an omega.</p> <p>On tour, we catch a whiff of her scent and everything changes. She's our scent match, and three of us are determined to have her.</p> <p>Between heats, bonds, and our instincts, it's going to be an interesting show.</p> <p><i>This is a medium-to-fast-burn, omegaverse, why-choose romance, meaning she doesn't have to choose. The story changes POVs between the main character and her men. The steaminess factor will go up as the duet goes on, and it is intended for mature listeners. This is book one of two and will end on a cliffhanger.</i></p>"; 
